# The hands while one speaks: the hero talks to Xardas through the dialog window and picks the first
# choice three times (they speak in turn, Xardas often several lines in a row). The camera in front of
# Xardas at the chest, the hero behind it clipped away. With `gestures off` on top of a copy: the old way
# (a random gesture with every line), for `diff`.
cheat god
view clean 30
overlay on
watch nearest
place 120 0
wait 300
cam front 230 140
cam look 125
dialog nearest
wait 1500
choose 1
rec answer1
wait 12000
stop
choose 1
rec answer2
wait 12000
stop
choose 1
rec answer3
wait 12000
stop
